<table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Feb 28, 2004 :: Big dead crystal dragon</div><P>I sure didnt' take a picture, but I'll go find one to steal somewhere to put here to show the big glass dragon in Valor. He was kind enough to donate a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Double_edged_Greatsword_of_Visions.jpeg">spiffy enormous sword</A> to Garacaius and Greylok got a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/honorablelongsword.jpg">pretty new sword </A>herself! </P>
<P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/ad.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>There's been a few more liches in the guild... Grats Kaministef and Moordread on 65! <BR>Grats Punkgurl on 64!<BR>Grats Lumalie on 62!<BR>Grats Emmajo on 61!<BR>Grats Mabh on 60.. but you're still not as cool as Druentia the kiting machine at AD...<BR>Grats Turtleman on 51 and Vicar!</P>
<P>Holler if I missed any levels.. at Arglar.</P>
<P>Oh! And biggest ass ever goes to YOUNGONE from FU.. though I don't think they want him either.&nbsp; Here's to hoping the wizard can get you a brain, assclown. </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Mar 1, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Feb 25, 2004 :: Quack! </div><P>Omigosh I forgot to add this before, but grats to Chawnti on your epic duck completed! I'll add a picture as I remember to get one fixed up!</P>
<P>And because he's just way too excited and too cute about it.. welcome Lovem as a full member! And the lovely Evangelle as well! I know, I don't normally announce those, but he's very excited. </P>
<P>Did a ring war for Lairiel last night, fun as always. Grats Lair on your Ring of Dain Frostreaver, Perragon won the Crown of Narandi and Kasiryn won the Choker of the Wretched! The rest of the stuff went to greed rolls. </P>
<P>We also got another talisman, this time Cerdiwan won it, and Grellk got some head! Then a whole bunch of earrings upgraded some folks and rotted. </P>
<P>There's been levels and stuff. /nods</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Feb 21, 2004 :: Very quiet rabbit hunting week..</div><P>Ah.. the week draws to a close and we've done relatively little. </P>
<P>Look soon to see (3) epic steps completed for folks, possibly a dragon kill, maybe even an LDoN/GoD raid complete.</P>
<P>Who knows.. we might .. /gasp see some levels if Wonderous actually writes them down.. I do know Duktak hit 56th!<BR><BR>Zorin got his Epic Note from the Overking!<BR>Papajay got his Epic Sword Piece from the Queen!<BR><BR>Must sleep.</P>
<P>&nbsp;</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Wonderous<br> :: Last edited by Wonderous on Feb 22, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Feb 20, 2004 :: I need to hire someone else to update this!</div><P>Okies, been a bit since anyone has touched this. I blame Arglar, as usual. </P>
<P>Had a little war in Iceclad and Dorina got her shawl finally! Big Grats! Some people won some greed rolls on the other drops, though I have no idea who really. It's all about the shawl!</P>
<P>Yeli gave up his head to Divan, Bryte got a mask, Spark got a robe and Anarandil got his neck. </P>
<P>Had a bigger, more exciting war for Beryllin who ended it with his Ring of Dain Frostreaver! Grats super tracker! Sindall got a nice neck and Punkgirl finally won the crown... will wonders never cease?! Rest of the hero stuff and lance went to greed, and I don't keep track of that stuff. </P>
<P>Worked on some more keying folks for BoT and actually a couple PoJ runs here and there through the week. Thanks Frogger for running those!</P>
<P>Got fresh blood in Sleepers and went in and got more prismatic for folks and some more quest stuff. And Jakr got a pair of the elusive Fistwraps! </P>
<P>Week of the new expansion was a bit slower along with the server crashes.. all that crashing with zoning, etc. Some folks explored the new zones and got some neat stuff. </P>
<P>Some...but I'm sure not all.. leveling grats!</P>
<P>Grats Brytelyte on 65 and Coercer!<BR>Grats Grellk on 65 and um..&nbsp; big knight title!<BR>Grats Kami on 64!<BR>Grats Punk on 63!<BR>Grats Belice on 55 and Templar!<BR>Grats Arwiin on 50!<BR>Grats Turtle on 47!<BR>Grats Emmajo on 58!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Feb 6, 2004 :: Hrm... I slack, therefore I am</div><P>Another weekday Ring War! Grats Jenrenee on your Ring of Dain Frostreaver! Other winners were Lairiel on the Crown of Narandi, Airosexiest on the Choker of the Wretched, Kelnya the Ghetto Rogue on the Faceguard of Bentos the Hero! The lance, earring and range thingie all went to greed rolls and um.. people won them. </P>
<P>Frogger led some folks to kill PoS minis again, getting a few more keyed up, and we had a couple groups head up again and finish off a couple more named. </P>
<P>Kasserole got the wifebeater from Sleepers, and Grellk got a lance (go go peircing skill!!), as well as Zav and Balut getting their much needed daggers. /nods</P>
<P>Some of the leveling grats I missed are: <BR>Grats Dorina on 65 and Prophet!<BR>Grats Sindall on 65 and Archon!<BR>Grellk&nbsp;on 63!<BR>Perragon on 60 and Crusader!<BR>Ewlala on 56!<BR>Reivan(muffins) on 55 and evoker!<BR>Demiana on 38! <BR><BR>I know I missed people, cause the motd kept poofing. I blame Arglar. </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Feb 7, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Feb 2, 2004 :: Grummus battle... artist rendering</div><P>Since none of ya bums thought ta take a picture of the fight and since I was a wee bit busy during it I thought ta make Meeka happy I would include my own rendition of what they battle was like for those that may have missed it.&nbsp;&nbsp; It is like you can almost still hear the clash of steel and the dying scream of Vorne.</P>
<P><IMG alt="Grummus battle" hspace=0 src="http://home.mchsi.com/~tonkatank/Grummus.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Arglar</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Feb 1, 2004 :: Vorne Dead!</div><P>No ring war trigger up for Jenrenee, so we'll have to wage war on the giants at a later date! Colwn and Vorne both got head to make some <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=4363">gloves</A> and Arglar's favorite <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=4362">belt</A>. Kithik got a <A href="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/loot.asp?itemid=223">nice new necklace</A>, Mahrsan got a <A href="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/loot.asp?itemid=172">nifty toy</A> so he can whine less when there's no shaman near him, Wonderous got a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6099">pretty little handbag</A>, Bery got a <A href="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/loot.asp?itemid=425">new mask</A>, Bufowski saved a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=4553">mace</A> from rot, Druentia saved a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6010">shield</A> from rot and both Bery and Zavitar saved a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=4625">crown</A> from rotting! </P>
<P>Decided to go kill the fat man and his lackeys. Great job everyone! Healers kept everyone healthy, Arglar held Grummus' attention rock solid, and Colwn offtanked the mob that was in his room.&nbsp; Mahrsan and Vorne did their great job pulling, and even got to scare Wonderous, which is so much fun. Nobody that I know of took pictures, so have to post someone elses. Oh, loot... Grats Mytee Mouse on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16497">Diseased Ratskin Mask</A> and Corbane on the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16655">Ring of the Pox-bearer</A>. Aramin's loot went to greed rolls... that <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16381">disease thingy staff</A> and some <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/bracerofrottingbile.JPG">resist chain class thing</A> that I forget. It looked like a white coldain shawl thingy. /nods</P>
<P><IMG alt=Fatty! hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/grummus.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Grats Kelnya and Sparkley&nbsp;on 63!<BR>Grats Dantiel on 61!<BR>Grats Grellk on 58!<BR>Grats Thrakish on 54!<BR></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Feb 1, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jan 31, 2004 :: Frogs Terrorize Giants!</div><P>Some frogs, and others, headed into Storms one night tearing beards, sashes and bones to finish up some keys into BoT. I think Bukowski was actually filming for his next adult frog film.. I mean.. come on.. he took their belts and then their 'bones?' What else could that mean. Especially on the tail of this... </P>
<P><IMG alt="Bukowski's home movies" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/frogpron0.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Killed more first broods, got more keys, and headed into Sleepers again. Grats Wonderous on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=25145">Bladesoul's Spiritual Diadem</A>! Emanci got a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16076">skull on a stick</A>, Greylok got a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16092">pretty poker</A>, Reide got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16298">wifebeater</A> (not to be used on Greylok.. unless she asks of course), Anarandil saved an <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16074">axe</A> from rotting and Colwn compensated for something with a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16075">lance</A>. </P>
<P>Leveling grats...<BR>Grats Bearbane on 65 and Overlord!<BR>Grats Darkyn on 63!<BR>Grats Valoura and Ahyth on 57!<BR>Grats Lovem on 55 and .. erm.. troubadour I think!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Jan 31, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages: <a href='news.asp?page=2'>&laquo;</a>&nbsp; <a href='news.asp?page=1'>1</a> <a href='news.asp?page=2'>2</a> 3 <a href='news.asp?page=4'>4</a> <a href='news.asp?page=5'>5</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=13'>13</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=4'>&raquo;</a></span></td>
